   m_sSRZReadText "Thermal fields. Field T-1. Invisible until something moves near it. Then a column of fire, two to three metres high, hot enough to melt a rifle stock. Heat shimmer over the ground is the only warning. The fire follows movement, not people. A bolt sets it off. Artifacts here come out warm and heavy and most of them heal the carrier while they cook him slowly."
